              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nababoolela mbu Nondekhwo, okhuba OMWAMI uhaanile abasuku beenywe abaMoabu mumukhono kweenywe. Nibakholomokha nibamulondakhwo, nibeekala tsinyambukho tsiaYorodani khubaMoabu, nibaramoka omundu yesi okhwambukha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mundaalo etsio nibeera abandu baMoabu shinga ebikhumila ekhumi, buli owamaani, buli oweitswoni; kata nareehonokokha omundu namulala ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Moabu yahulwa inyanga eyo hasi womukhono kwaIsiraeli. Eshialo nishihuluukha emiyika amakhumi munaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
